{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00599","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享龙池乐章 第十章 · 裴璀","name":"郊庙歌辞 享龙池乐章 第十章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乾坤啓圣吐龙泉，泉水年年胜一年。\n始看鱼跃方成海，即覩龙飞利在天。\n洲渚遥将银汉接，楼台直与紫微连。\n休气荣光常不散，悬知此地是神仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴璀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00599.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00599","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}